{
  "id": "check-completing-the-square-2",
  "title": "Check: Completing the Square",
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "type": "multiple-choice",
      "difficulty": "knowledge-check",
      "stem": "Write $x^2 - 10x + 30$ in the form $(x + a)^2 + b$.",
      "options": [
        { "id": "a", "text": "$(x - 5)^2 - 5$" },
        { "id": "b", "text": "$(x - 5)^2 + 5$" },
        { "id": "c", "text": "$(x - 10)^2 + 30$" },
        { "id": "d", "text": "$(x + 5)^2 + 5$" }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "b",
      "explanation": "Half the coefficient of $x$ is $-5$. So $x^2 - 10x = (x-5)^2 - 25$. Then $x^2 - 10x + 30 = (x-5)^2 - 25 + 30 = (x-5)^2 + 5$."
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "type": "multiple-choice",
      "difficulty": "knowledge-check",
      "stem": "The expression $x^2 - 4x + 7$ is written as $(x - 2)^2 + 3$. What is the minimum value of this expression?",
      "options": [
        { "id": "a", "text": "$-2$" },
        { "id": "b", "text": "$2$" },
        { "id": "c", "text": "$3$" },
        { "id": "d", "text": "$7$" }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "c",
      "explanation": "Since $(x - 2)^2 \\geq 0$ for all values of $x$, the minimum value of $(x-2)^2 + 3$ is $0 + 3 = 3$, which occurs when $x = 2$."
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "type": "multiple-choice",
      "difficulty": "knowledge-check",
      "stem": "Write $2x^2 + 12x + 5$ in the form $a(x + b)^2 + c$.",
      "options": [
        { "id": "a", "text": "$2(x + 3)^2 - 13$" },
        { "id": "b", "text": "$2(x + 6)^2 - 67$" },
        { "id": "c", "text": "$2(x + 3)^2 + 5$" },
        { "id": "d", "text": "$(2x + 6)^2 - 31$" }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "a",
      "explanation": "Factor out $2$: $2(x^2 + 6x) + 5$. Complete the square: $2((x+3)^2 - 9) + 5 = 2(x+3)^2 - 18 + 5 = 2(x+3)^2 - 13$."
    }
  ]
}
